<title>UK: Alvis in munitions disposal joint venture.</title>
<headline>Alvis in munitions disposal joint venture.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>British specialist engineering and defence specialist Alvis Plc said on Wednesday it set up a joint venture with Colt Industrial Services to specialise in disposing of explosives.</p>
<p>Alvis said it holds 50 percent of the joint venture which will market a water jet cutting system for use in military applications, primarily munitions disposal. The system can cut without raising temperatures and causing significant vibration.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
